---
import { LONGEVITY_GUIDE as guide } from "@/data/longevityGuide";
import "@/styles/article-prose.css";
---

<section
  id="longevity-guide"
  class="border-b border-border py-6"
  aria-labelledby="longevity-intro"
>
  <article id="article" class="article-prose">
    <h2 id="longevity-intro">AI 生命延续学，从哪里入门？</h2>
    <p>{guide.definition}</p>
    <p class="text-sm">{guide.authorScope} <a href="/about/">关于我</a></p>
    <p class="text-sm">
      指南更新于 <time datetime={guide.updatedAt}>{guide.updatedAt}</time>
    </p>
    <h2 id="ai-immortality">AI 能让人长生不老吗？</h2>
    <p>{guide.answer}</p>
    <dl class="space-y-4">
      {
        guide.concepts.map(item => (
          <div>
            <>
              <dt class="font-semibold">{item.name}</dt>
              <dd>
                <p>
                  {item.meaning}
                  {item.limit}
                </p>
              </dd>
            </>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </dl>
    <h2 id="longevity-evidence">读一条研究，先看它到了哪一步</h2>
    <p>先问研究对象，再看结论。别省掉“在哪些条件下成立”这半句话。</p>
    <div
      class="table-scroll"
      tabindex="0"
      role="region"
      aria-label="研究证据阶段比较，可横向滚动"
    >
      <table>
        <caption class="sr-only">不同研究阶段的检查方法和限制</caption>
        <thead
          ><tr
            ><th scope="col">材料</th><th scope="col">读的时候看什么</th><th
              scope="col">不要推到哪里</th
            ></tr
          ></thead
        >
        <tbody
          >{
            guide.evidence.map(item => (
              <tr>
                <>
                  <th scope="row">{item.stage}</th>
                  <td>{item.check}</td>
                  <td>{item.limit}</td>
                </>
              </tr>
            ))
          }</tbody
        >
      </table>
    </div>
    <h2 id="longevity-reading">接下来可以读什么、做什么？</h2>
    <ol>{guide.steps.map(step => <li>{step}</li>)}</ol>
    <p>
      <a href="/projects/aging-clock-atlas/">比较多维衰老时钟与开源项目</a
      >，或去 <a href="https://news.aibioo.cn/">BioAI 日报</a>继续找研究线索。
    </p>
    {
      guide.questions.map(item => (
        <section>
          <>
            <h3>{item.question}</h3>
            <p>{item.answer}</p>
          </>
        </section>
      ))
    }
    <h2 id="longevity-references">参考资料</h2>
    <ul>
      {
        guide.sources.map(source => (
          <li>
            <a href={source.url}>{source.title}</a>（{source.kind}）
            <p>{source.purpose}</p>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>
  </article>
</section>

<style>
  #longevity-guide {
    min-width: 0;
  }
  #longevity-guide .article-prose {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }
  #longevity-guide h2 {
    margin-block: 2rem 0.75rem;
    font-size: 1.375rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  #longevity-guide h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  #longevity-guide h3 {
    margin-block: 1.5rem 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  #longevity-guide .table-scroll {
    overflow-x: auto;
    max-width: 100%;
  }
  #longevity-guide table {
    min-width: 34rem;
  }
  #longevity-guide th {
    text-align: start;
  }
</style>
